1) BrowserRouter > broser me routing kr skte hai, or sub kuch client based routing huti
mostly yahe use huga

instagram.com = /  
instagram.com/feed = /feed
instagram.com/messages = /messages

2) HashRouter > server ko pata nahi chalta ke ap kis route per hai jab apko hide rakhna ho
bht kam use huta hai

instagram.com = /#/ 
instagram.com/feed = /#/feed
instagram.com/messages = /#/messages

3) MemoryRouter > memory me chezein store karta hai
ReactNative ki apps me use huta hai

4) StaticRouter > static side generation me, ye nextjs me use huta hai